
         
         <p>The <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ef-themes</code> are a collection of light and dark themes for GNU
Emacs that provide colourful (“pretty”) yet legible options for users
who want something with a bit more flair than my <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">modus-themes</code> or my
minimalist <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">doric-themes</code>.</p>

