<h2>Version 2.3.0 on 2026-11-18</h2>

<p>This version introduces a pair of new themes to the collection:
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ef-halloween-light</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ef-halloween-dark</code>. I produced the prototype
of the dark theme during a livestream, if you are curious to learn
about the process: <a href="https://protesilaos.com/codelog/2026-10-31-emacs-live-ef-themes-halloween/">https://protesilaos.com/codelog/2026-10-31-emacs-live-ef-themes-halloween/</a>.</p>

<p>The two themes add to an already comprehensive collection that covers
a broad spectrum of styles. All themes are consistent with the spirit
of avoiding exaggerations while remaining legible.</p>

<p>Note that since version <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">2.0.0</code>, the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ef-themes</code> are built on top of
my <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">modus-themes</code>. They benefit from all the changes I make there.</p>
